      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the explanation. so it's basically just a crystallization issue with the cocoa butter, right? i'm trying to get the temperature curves exactly right. can you walk me through the specific temperature stages for dark chocolate—like the melting, cooling, and reheating points—to make sure i'm getting the right crystal structure? i really want to stop that bloom from appearing.",
